Feature: Validate Hone Page Arrivals

Background:
Given user launches the prowser and navigates to "https://practice.automationtesting.in/ "

Scenario:Validate Home Page has only three Arrivals
    When the user clicks on the "Shop" menu
    And the user clicks on the "Home" menu
    Then the Home page should display exactly three Arrivals
 
Scenario: Validate navigation from Arrival image to product detail page
    Given the Home page displays three Arrivals
    When the user clicks on any Arrival image
    Then the user should be navigated to the product detail page
    And the user should be able to add the book to the basket